{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project: ASCESIS</strong> will offer you a first-person horror experience like you've never had before. You will explore two interconnected dimensions: the real world and a disturbing video game developed by the company your now-missing wife worked for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A story to uncover, two realities to experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to switch between realities, a crucial ability for solving puzzles, uncovering hidden secrets, and navigating a fragmented, mysterious narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846670/extras/5971a7d2309a7c77427e98a02c827a6a.poster.avif?t=1762123568\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846670/extras/5971a7d2309a7c77427e98a02c827a6a.webm?t=1762123568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846670/extras/5971a7d2309a7c77427e98a02c827a6a.mp4?t=1762123568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90s environments with a retro-modern aesthetic, unsettling atmospheres, and a constant feeling that something isn\u2019t quite right.  <br>Will you uncover the mystery behind the cancellation of <strong>ASCESIS</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846670/extras/99c01b21163ed019c0a8ce82f37f371b.poster.avif?t=1762123568\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846670/extras/99c01b21163ed019c0a8ce82f37f371b.webm?t=1762123568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846670/extras/99c01b21163ed019c0a8ce82f37f371b.mp4?t=1762123568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mechanics, puzzles, and environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A truth you never wanted to know</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New ways to make you scared</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846670/extras/9e93cc4e875391ef83885a51fd2f0c7f.poster.avif?t=1762123568\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846670/extras/9e93cc4e875391ef83885a51fd2f0c7f.webm?t=1762123568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846670/extras/9e93cc4e875391ef83885a51fd2f0c7f.mp4?t=1762123568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember... <strong>Keep Playing ASCESIS</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846670?t=1762123568","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846670?t=1762123568","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846670/300ec8055280fc7a3fd0bf25aa820dda0322a217/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762123568","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846670/300ec8055280fc7a3fd0bf25aa820dda0322a217/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762123568","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"de